:GRAPH Antimicrobial_Use
:TITLE Antimicrobial Use
:X-AXIS Time
:SCALE
:VAR Cumulative antimicrobial usage
:DATASET 
:LINE-COLOR 255-0-128
:LINE-WIDTH 3
:SCALE
:VAR Metaphylactic usage
:DATASET 
:LINE-COLOR 0-255-0
:LINE-WIDTH 2
:SCALE
:VAR Therapeutic usage
:DATASET 
:LINE-WIDTH 2

:GRAPH Economic_Outcomes
:TITLE Economic Outcomes
:SCALE
:VAR Profit
:DATASET 
:LINE-WIDTH 3
:SCALE
:VAR Herd Revenue
:DATASET 
:LINE-COLOR 0-255-0
:LINE-WIDTH 2
:SCALE
:VAR Total Production Loss
:DATASET 
:LINE-COLOR 255-0-0
:LINE-WIDTH 2
:SCALE
:VAR Healthcare cost
:DATASET 
:LINE-COLOR 0-255-255
:LINE-WIDTH 2

:GRAPH SEIRQ
:TITLE SEIRQ
:SCALE
:VAR Susceptible
:DATASET 
:LINE-WIDTH 1
:VAR Infected
:DATASET 
:LINE-WIDTH 2
:VAR Exposed
:DATASET 
:LINE-WIDTH 2
:VAR Quarantine
:DATASET 
:LINE-WIDTH 2
:VAR Recovered
:DATASET 
:LINE-WIDTH 2
